 ### Administration
 
 The order detail page now shows the technical name of the payment method in its tooltip.
+
+### Core
+
+`LegacyProductStockSubscriber` is deprecated and will be removed in 6.8.0.0. `ProductStockIndexer` already refreshes the product stock, so remove any decoration or extension of the subscriber.
diff --git a/UPGRADE-6.8.md b/UPGRADE-6.8.md
--- a/UPGRADE-6.8.md
+++ b/UPGRADE-6.8.md
@@ -5,3 +5,7 @@
 ## Reorder form line item blocks removed
 
 `frontend.checkout.cart.reorder` resolves the reordered products from the order itself, so the reorder form no longer posts any `lineItems`.
+
+## `LegacyProductStockSubscriber` removed
+
+`ProductStockIndexer` refreshes the product stock, so `LegacyProductStockSubscriber` is removed. Remove any decoration or extension of the subscriber.
